WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.180
Cyprus.

2
00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:05.970
A storm has wrecked the enemy fleet, and
a general comes ashore to his waiting

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:06.890
wife.

4
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.220
He tells her, "O my soul’s joy!"

5
00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:13.260
It is the happiest moment of his life.

6
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:14.520
Act 5.

7
00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:17.000
A bedchamber, one candle.

8
00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:22.680
He says, "Put out the light, and then
put out the light:" Look at the clock:

9
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.840
hardly any time has passed.

10
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.770
How does a loving husband
become a killer so fast?

11
00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:31.440
In this mission, you'll map the five acts,

12
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:35.160
from a secret marriage in
Venice to a death in Cyprus.

13
00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.820
You'll trace the tragic shape:
the rise, the turning point,

14
00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:39.970
and the fall.

15
00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:44.570
And you'll check the clock in
Cyprus: how much time really passes?

16
00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:48.060
Your mission: work out
how it happened so fast.
